--      competition, eligibility and award criteria, application conditions, evaluation commission, notice, applicant and offer evaluation) and
--      REQ-12 (M820-13), REQ-15 / REQ-16 (M820-14), REQ-17 (M820-11) get the guard IF procurement_procedure != 'direktvergabe'. No sheet is
--      hidden or deactivated; M820-20 (negotiations also happen in a direct award), M820-21, M820-22, M820-24 and the justification
--      procedure_rationale (M820-10) stay. Suchverfahren / Planungswettbewerb / VgV-F: unchanged. procurement_procedure reaches M820-13 and
--      M820-15 (consumer_worksheets). Basis: § 8.8 definition (one company) — see SOURCES.
--   2. Gates for the wrong reason: REQ-02 (M820-04) only when a concept is drawn up (project_type != projekt) and the four concept-needs
--      fields hidden for „Projekt“ (§ 4.1, § 6.2 vs § 6.4); 820-2 REQ-12 field reworded to „cost targets with a uniform cost structure (e.g.
--      DIN 276)“ — condition unchanged, label/hint/clause changed (§ 4.5.1 „bspw. DIN 276“); 820-2 REQ-33 guarded by a new yes/no driver
--      oeffentlichkeitsbeteiligung_vorgesehen (§ 5.3.10 „Je nach Projekt“). REQ-31, REQ-47 (see 3), 820-3 REQ-27 / REQ-30: sign-off 64_.
--   3. Phase timing (820-2): three new required yes/no drivers „Phase … erreicht“ — phase_ausfuehrung_erreicht (820-2-20, also read on
--      820-2-21), phase_inbetriebnahme_erreicht (820-2-22, also read on 820-2-23), phase_gewaehrleistung_erreicht (820-2-24, visible only with
--      LPH 9 + awarded construction works). „No“ hides the phase-bound questions and REQ-43, REQ-47, REQ-48, REQ-49, REQ-51, REQ-52 do not
--      apply yet; „Yes“ = as today; unanswered = questions visible, block gates wait and name the driver. Severities unchanged.
--   4. Options: 820-1 sector token `wasserwirtschaft` (printed in § 1; REQ-01 list extended); 820-2-05 mgmt_cycle_frequency token
--      `anlassbezogen` labelled „(Werkzeug-Option)“. Booleans are NOT converted to „teilweise“ (ruling → 64_).
--   5. Ask once (hints only): M820-05 bedarfsplanung_projekt_complete is named the master; M820-04 aufgabenbeschreibung_eindeutig, 820-2-11
--      framework_conditions_clarified and M8203-11 pz_62_1_status say they repeat it. No data linking (carry-over = code item in 64_).
--   6. 820-2-04 new optional register weitere_regelwerke (columns regelwerk / ausgabe / anwendung), pattern of the DIN and DWA registers.
--   Counts: 63 field rows updated, 14 gate rows updated (severity never changes), 5 field rows inserted. Every changed hint is DE + [EN].
